@startuml Architecture Sequence Diagram
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam boxPadding 10
skinparam participantPadding 10

box "开发者 / 运维人员" #LightYellow
participant "Developer / DevOps" as Dev
end box

box "GitHub 影子仓库 (server-deploy-by-ga)" #Azure
participant "GitHub Actions\n(GA Runner)" as GA
participant "deliver.py\n(制品分发引擎)" as Deliver
participant "send-dingtalk.js\n(通知引擎)" as DingNotifier
end box

box "代码托管平台" #LightGrey
participant "私有 Git 仓库\n(Git Provider)" as GitRepo
end box

box "目标云服务器" #LightGreen
participant "制品暂存区\n(${SERVER_ARTIFACT_DIR})" as ArtifactDir
participant "本地部署 Hook\n(deploy.sh)" as HookScript
participant "应用运行环境 & 容器编排\n(App Run Dir & Compose)" as ContainerApp
end box

box "消息通知服务" #LightPink
participant "IM 通知机器人\n(Notification Bot)" as Bot
end box

== 阶段一：触发管道 ==
Dev -> GA: 触发 Workflow\n(可选指定 git_repo_url / git_ref)

== 阶段二：源码检出与云端编译 ==
GA -> GitRepo: 1. 使用 GIT_SSH_KEY 克隆业务源码 (git clone)
GitRepo --> GA: 返回代码包 (含 deploy/artifacts.manifest & deploy/.github/deploy.sh)
GA -> GA: 2. 配置云端编译环境 (JDK / Node / Go)
GA -> GA: 3. 执行编译打包 (mvn clean package)

== 阶段三：制品筛选与安全分发 ==
GA -> Deliver: 4. 执行 Python 交付脚本 (deliver.py)
Deliver -> GA: 读取 deploy/artifacts.manifest 声明规则
Deliver -> ArtifactDir: 5. SSH 远程清空暂存目录 (rm -rf ${SERVER_ARTIFACT_DIR}/*)
Deliver -> ArtifactDir: 6. SCP 上传匹配的独立服务制品文件
Deliver -> ArtifactDir: 7. SCP 上传版本化 deploy/.github/deploy.sh 脚本
Deliver -> GA: 导出交付清单 (${ARTIFACT_LIST}) 供通知消费

== 阶段四：触发服务器回调 Hook 执行本地部署 ==
GA -> HookScript: 8. SSH 远程触发: bash ${SERVER_ARTIFACT_DIR}/deploy.sh
HookScript -> ArtifactDir: 扫描接收到的最新制品文件
HookScript -> ContainerApp: 覆盖更新至指定服务运行目录
HookScript -> ContainerApp: 执行容器编排增量重启 (docker compose up -d)
HookScript -> ContainerApp: 执行应用健康探活校验
HookScript --> GA: 返回 Shell 脚本执行结果

== 阶段五：模板化 Markdown 结果通知 ==
GA -> DingNotifier: 9. 执行通知脚本 (send-dingtalk.js)
DingNotifier -> Bot: 10. POST 推送渲染后的 Markdown 通知卡片\n(含制品清单、分支、提交ID、加签)
Bot --> Dev: 接收部署结果通知

@enduml
